IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `nt-part2-commencement`

-- Tests of nt-part2-commencement.l4.
-- Every expected value is written from the text of the section named beside it.

§ `Section 7: evidence of dates`

-- Subsection (1): the date on a copy printed by the Government Printer that purports to be the day assent was given.
#ASSERT `s 7: the day of which the date appearing on the printed copy is evidence` `the day on which assent was given to an Act` (Date 3 4 2019) TRUE EQUALS JUST (Date 3 4 2019)
-- Subsection (2).
#ASSERT `s 7: the day of which the date appearing on the printed copy is evidence` `the day on which assent to an Act was notified in the Gazette` (Date 10 4 2019) TRUE EQUALS JUST (Date 10 4 2019)
-- Subsection (3)(a) and (b).
#ASSERT `s 7: the day of which the date appearing on the printed copy is evidence` `the date on which subordinate legislation was made` (Date 1 2 2020) TRUE EQUALS JUST (Date 1 2 2020)
#ASSERT `s 7: the day of which the date appearing on the printed copy is evidence` `the date on which subordinate legislation was notified in the Gazette` (Date 5 2 2020) TRUE EQUALS JUST (Date 5 2 2020)
-- A copy not printed by the Government Printer: the text says nothing.
#ASSERT `s 7: the day of which the date appearing on the printed copy is evidence` `the day on which assent was given to an Act` (Date 3 4 2019) FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 7: the day of which the date appearing on the printed copy is evidence` `the date on which subordinate legislation was made` (Date 1 2 2020) FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
-- A date that purports to be something else.
#ASSERT `s 7: the day of which the date appearing on the printed copy is evidence` `something other than these four dates` (Date 3 4 2019) TRUE EQUALS NOTHING

§ `Section 8: exercise of powers before commencement`

#ASSERT `s 8(1): the power may be exercised before the provision commences` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 8(1): the power may be exercised before the provision commences` FALSE EQUALS NOTHING

-- Subsection (2)(a): on the commencement.
#ASSERT `s 8(2): the instrument or thing may take effect on that day` (Date 1 7 2023) (Date 1 7 2023) FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 8(2): the instrument or thing may take effect on that day` (Date 1 7 2023) (Date 1 7 2023) TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- Subsection (2)(b): before the commencement, to the extent necessary for the effective operation of the Act.
#ASSERT `s 8(2): the instrument or thing may take effect on that day` (Date 30 6 2023) (Date 1 7 2023) TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 8(2): the instrument or thing may take effect on that day` (Date 30 6 2023) (Date 1 7 2023) FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
-- After the commencement the text does not say.
#ASSERT `s 8(2): the instrument or thing may take effect on that day` (Date 2 7 2023) (Date 1 7 2023) TRUE EQUALS NOTHING

-- Subsection (3).
#ASSERT `s 8(3): subsection (1) applies to the provision` `in the Act as enacted` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 8(3): subsection (1) applies to the provision` `to be inserted into the Act by another Act` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 8(3): subsection (1) applies to the provision` `somewhere else` EQUALS NOTHING

§ `Section 9: amendment before commencement`

-- Paragraphs (a) and (b): after passing and before commencing.
#ASSERT `s 9(a), (b): the proposed law may be cited by its proposed short title and be the subject of a further proposed law to amend or repeal it` `passed by the Legislative Assembly and not yet commenced` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 9(a), (b): the proposed law may be cited by its proposed short title and be the subject of a further proposed law to amend or repeal it` `not yet passed by the Legislative Assembly` EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 9(a), (b): the proposed law may be cited by its proposed short title and be the subject of a further proposed law to amend or repeal it` `commenced` EQUALS JUST FALSE

-- Closing words: the amending provision commences before, or on the same day as, the provision it amends.
#ASSERT `s 9: the Act or provision amended or repealed commences only as amended, or for the purpose of making the repeal effective` (Date 1 7 2023) (Date 1 7 2023) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 9: the Act or provision amended or repealed commences only as amended, or for the purpose of making the repeal effective` (Date 30 6 2023) (Date 1 7 2023) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 9: the Act or provision amended or repealed commences only as amended, or for the purpose of making the repeal effective` (Date 2 7 2023) (Date 1 7 2023) EQUALS JUST FALSE
